---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "../../../components/common/Container.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="锦乃｜初代试作江户城｜WORKS"
  description=""
>

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="relative h-[920px] overflow-hidden bg-[#f5f1ea]">

  <img
    src="/images/nishikino-edo-1.jpg"
    alt="初代试作江户城"
    class="work-hero absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover pointer-events-none select-none"
    draggable="false"
  />

  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#f6f1e7]/85 via-[#f6f1e7]/45 to-transparent"></div>

  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-20 flex items-center">

    <Container>

      <div class="hero-content max-w-3xl">

        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#8a7558]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          FIRST PROTOTYPE OF EDO CASTLE
        </p>

        <h1
          class="mt-1 text-[38px] leading-[1.15] text-[#30261f]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          初代试作江户城
        </h1>

        <p
          class="mt-6 text-xl text-[#5a4a3b]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          至今留存的最初起点，一切皆由此开始。
        </p>

        <div class="mt-12 flex items-center">
          <div class="h-[1px] w-[360px] bg-[#caa14d]"></div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </Container>

  </div>

  <div class="absolute bottom-16 right-12 z-30 flex flex-col items-center">

    <div class="h-20 w-px bg-white/70"></div>

    <span class="mt-4 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-white">
      SCROLL
    </span>

  </div>

</section>

<!-- Introduction -->
<section class="relative bg-[#f8f6f2] overflow-hidden works-detail">

  <img
    src="/images/washi-bg.png"
    alt=""
    class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-full opacity-[0.3] pointer-events-none select-none -z-0"
  />

  <Container class="py-32 relative z-10">

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">

        <span class="h-px w-24 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#9a8358]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          OVERVIEW
        </p>

      </div>

      <h2
        class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        作品概要
      </h2>

      <p
        class="mt-10 max-w-4xl text-base leading-10 text-[#55504a]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        初代试作江户城是我在《我的世界：携带版》时代制作的作品，也是现存至今最早的一件作品。<br>
        最初只是作为生存据点，从一座小型天守开始，经过数次扩建，最终发展成为一座形制相当于现今皇居东御苑范围的日式城郭。
      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto mt-20 max-w-6xl"></div>

    <div class="mx-auto mt-24 grid max-w-6xl gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_360px]">

      <div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

          <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#9a8358]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            HISTORY
          </p>

        </div>

        <h2
          class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          关于初代试作江户城
        </h2>

        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base leading-10 text-[#4f4944]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >

        这是我的起点，也是我最早期的日式建筑作品，如今仍然保存着，也是现存至今最早的一件作品。

        <br><br>

        在手机版《我的世界》基岩版还被称为《Minecraft: Pocket Edition》的时代，我从在互联网上看到的“纳米积木江户城”获得灵感，将其作为自己的生存据点进行了还原，这便是一切的开始。

        <br><br>

        后来，仅仅建造天守已经无法满足我，于是规模逐渐扩大，从天守改造，到橹、护城河、城门，再到御殿建筑。最终，整个城郭发展成了与如今皇居东御苑范围相当的形制。

        <br><br>

        完工后，随着我从手机转移到电脑，世界存档也一同迁移。得益于我一直以来都十分珍重地保存着这个世界，它至今仍保留着当时的样貌。

        <br><br>

        我记得当初制作天守时，并没有计划制作整个城郭，因此在撰写文章时，我重新对这个世界进行了挖掘与考证。

        <br>

        最终发现，<br>
        地下出土了城门、护城河以及橹台的石垣。旧天守台的遗迹，以及并列分布的旧本丸、二之丸、三之丸轮廓也逐渐显现出来。<br><br>

        由此可以确认，“初代试作江户城”是在不断进行阶段性扩建的过程中，逐渐演变成了以如今皇居东御苑为参照的城郭防御结构。

        <br><br>

        通过这次制作，我从“建造一座属于自己的生存据点”转变为“制作现实中真实存在的事物”。即使到了今天，这件作品依然是我日式建筑创作风格的原点。

        <br><br>

        在通过这件学习江户城结构的作品（第一阶段）之后，我的制作开始迎来下一项挑战——“按照真实事物的形制进行还原”。

        随后便延续到了我在中学生时代制作的第二阶段作品《二代试作江户城》。

        </p>

      </div>

      <aside class="relative">

        <div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-[#e2d8cb] bg-[#fffdfa] p-10 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,.07)]">

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#a68b64]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            DATA
          </p>

          <div class="mt-10 space-y-8">

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">作品名</p>
              <p class="text-base">初代试作江户城</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">分类</p>
              <p class="text-base">日式城郭</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">建造年代</p>
              <p class="text-base">2015年5月～7月下旬</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">所在地</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                建筑保存用世界（原试作本原址：〒100-0001 东京都千代田区千代田一丁目1番）
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">筑城年代</p>
              <p class="text-base">（原试作本原型：庆长年间～宽永年间）</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">筑城者</p>
              <p class="text-base">锦乃（原试作本原型：德川将军家）</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">形式</p>
              <p class="text-base">平城</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">制作软件</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                Minecraft: Pocket Edition 0.11.0<br>
                （根据当时的笔记确认）
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">作品类别</p>
              <p class="text-base">日式建筑・还原试作</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">制作状态</p>
              <p class="text-base">完成（保存在Minecraft Java Edition中）</p>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>

      </aside>

    </div>

<!-- Gallery -->

<div class="mx-auto mt-32 max-w-6xl">

  <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

    <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

    <p
      class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
      style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
    >
      GALLERY
    </p>

  </div>

  <h2
    class="mt-6 text-4xl"
    style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
  >
    展示照片
  </h2>

  <div class="gallery mt-12">

    <div class="gallery-frame">
      <img
        src="/images/nishikino-edo-1.jpg"
        alt="初代试作江户城"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="gallery-frame">
      <img
        src="/images/nishikino-edo-2.png"
        alt="初代试作江户城"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="gallery-frame">
      <img
        src="/images/nishikino-edo-3.png"
        alt="初代试作江户城发掘"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="gallery-frame">
      <img
        src="/images/nishikino-edo-4.png"
        alt="初代试作江户城"
      />
    </div>

  </div>

</div>

    <div class="mt-24">

      <a
        href="/zh-cn/works/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        ← 查看其他作品
      </a>

      <a
        href="/zh-cn/first/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        ← 起点
      </a>

      <a
        href="/zh-cn/nishikinoedocastle2/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        下一件作品 →
      </a>

      <div class="mt-32 text-center">

        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-5">

          <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            SHARE
          </p>

          <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        </div>

        <h2
          class="mt-6 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          分享作品
        </h2>

        <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-4 flex-wrap">

          <a
            href="#"
            id="x-share"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            X
          </a>

          <button
            type="button"
            id="instagram-share"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            Instagram
          </button>

          <button
            type="button"
            id="copy-url"
            class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
          >
            复制URL
          </button>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </Container>

</section>

<script>
  const sharePhrases = [
    "找到这个了。",
    "这个莫名有点喜欢。",
    "看看这个。",
    "发现了个挺让人在意的东西。",
    "发现了这个。",
    "你知道这个吗？",
    "发现了个东西。",
    "原来还有这个。",
    "发现了个有点在意的东西。"
  ];

  const randomPhrase =
    sharePhrases[Math.floor(Math.random() * sharePhrases.length)];

  const pageUrl =
    "https://www.nishikinolab.net/zh-cn/nishikinoedocastle1/";

  const shareText =
    `${randomPhrase} Minecraft 初代试作江户城 | WORKS`;

  const xShareButton = document.getElementById("x-share");
  const copyButton = document.getElementById("copy-url");
  const instagramButton = document.getElementById("instagram-share");

  xShareButton?.setAttribute(
    "href",
    `https://x.com/intent/post?text=${encodeURIComponent(shareText)}&url=${encodeURIComponent(pageUrl)}`
  );

  copyButton?.addEventListener("click", async () => {
    try {
      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(pageUrl);

      if (copyButton) {
        copyButton.textContent = "已复制";

        setTimeout(() => {
          copyButton.textContent = "复制URL";
        }, 2000);
      }
    } catch (error) {
      console.error(error);
    }
  });

  instagramButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {

    const dialog = document.createElement("div");

    dialog.innerHTML = `
      <div
        id="instagram-share-overlay"
        style="
          position:fixed;
          inset:0;
          z-index:9999;
          display:flex;
          align-items:center;
          justify-content:center;
          padding:24px;
          background:rgba(43,39,36,.55);
          backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
        "
      >
        <div
          style="
            width:100%;
            max-width:420px;
            padding:36px;
            border:1px solid #e2d8cb;
            border-radius:28px;
            background:#fffdfa;
            box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
            text-align:center;
          "
        >

          <p
            style="
              margin:0;
              font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              letter-spacing:.35em;
              color:#a58c65;
            "
          >
            SHARE
          </p>

          <h3
            style="
              margin:14px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:24px;
              color:#2b2724;
              font-weight:400;
            "
          >
            在Instagram分享
          </h3>

          <p
            style="
              margin:20px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              line-height:2;
              color:#625a52;
            "
          >
            复制此作品页面的URL后<br>
            打开Instagram。
          </p>

          <button
            id="instagram-open"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:28px;
              padding:14px 20px;
              border:1px solid #d7c8b3;
              border-radius:999px;
              background:#2b2724;
              color:#fff;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:15px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            复制URL并打开Instagram
          </button>

          <button
            id="instagram-cancel"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:10px;
              padding:12px 20px;
              border:0;
              background:transparent;
              color:#8c8378;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            取消
          </button>

        </div>
      </div>
    `;

    document.body.appendChild(dialog);

    const overlay = document.getElementById("instagram-share-overlay");
    const openButton = document.getElementById("instagram-open");
    const cancelButton = document.getElementById("instagram-cancel");

    openButton?.addEventListener("click", async () => {

      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(pageUrl);
      } catch (error) {
        console.error(error);
      }

      window.open(
        "https://www.instagram.com/",
        "_blank",
        "noopener,noreferrer"
      );

      overlay?.remove();
    });

    cancelButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {
      overlay?.remove();
    });

    overlay?.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
      if (event.target === overlay) {
        overlay.remove();
      }
    });
  });
</script>

<style>

.work-hero{
  animation:heroFloat 12s ease-in-out infinite;
  transform-origin:center;
}

@keyframes heroFloat{

0%{
transform:scale(1.03) translateY(0);
}

50%{
transform:scale(1.06) translateY(-18px);
}

100%{
transform:scale(1.03) translateY(0);
}

}


section{
position:relative;
}

section::before{
content:"";
position:absolute;
left:0;
top:0;
width:100%;
height:100%;
pointer-events:none;
background-image:
radial-gradient(circle at 8% 10%,rgba(205,175,98,.08),transparent 18%),
radial-gradient(circle at 92% 82%,rgba(205,175,98,.06),transparent 22%);
}

aside{
position:sticky;
top:120px;
height:max-content;
}

a{
transition:.35s;
}

@media(max-width:1100px){

section{
overflow:hidden;
}

}


@media(max-width:768px){

section:first-child{
height:760px;
}

.work-hero{
animation:none;
}

}

.gallery-frame {
  position: relative;
  padding: 2px;
  border-radius: 1.25rem;

  background:
    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.65) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.65) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.65) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );

  overflow: hidden;
}

.gallery-frame img {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;

  border-radius: calc(1.25rem - 2px);

  background: #f8f6f2;
}

.gallery-frame:hover {
  background:
    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.9) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.9) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.9) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );
}

</style>

</Layout>